#   The subject asks for two things of this file and no more: that it          #
#   "compiles your project", and that it "must not relink". It names no rule    #
#   beyond that -- no all, no clean, no fclean, no re -- so the harness         #
#   demands none of them, and adding them is your choice rather than a          #
#   requirement. $(NAME) is first so a bare `make` reaches it.                  #
